      <scopecontent id="aspace_3137dda17506ad994e22e7f80f18f849">
         <head>Scope and Contents</head>
         <p>Material in this collection consists of bound correspondence regarding the history and sites within Hertford.  This correspondence contributed to Clutterbuck's three volume work <title>
               <part>The History and Antiquities of the County of Hertford, compiled from the best printed authorities and original records</part>
            </title>, (London: Nichols, Son, and Bentley, 1815, 1821, 1827).</p>
      </scopecontent>
